# Operator secrets for the container stack (obligation S4). `.env` is read
# automatically by compose and is excluded from the Docker build context, so a
# session secret lives in exactly one place and never in a layer or a commit.
# Ship `.env.example` instead.
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example

